in production<\/span><br>https:\/\/variety.com\/2026\/film\/news\/<wbr>crazy-taxi-movie-netflix-sega-sonic<wbr>-stranger-than-heaven-1236861148\/<br><br>==COMICS==<br>Sonic the Hedgehog #90 - 30 September 2026<br>Sonic the Hedgehog X Godzilla #3 - 14 October 2026<br>Sonic and the Blade of Courage #17 - October 2026<br><br>==OTHER==<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;General Links<\/span><br>https:\/\/rentry.org\/sthglinks<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;SAGE<\/span><br>https:\/\/sagexpo.org\/<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;SHC<\/span><br>https:\/\/shc.zone\/<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;#10000 Project<\/span><br>https:\/\/pastebin.com\/Fb8Bt4ru<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Support BoC!<\/span><br>https:\/\/bookwalker.jp\/series\/568134<wbr>\/list\/<br><br>Previous Zone: <a href=\"\/vg\/thread\/581404670#p581404670\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;581404670<\/a>","filename":"128498595_p0_master1200","ext":".jpg","w":1000,"h":1200,"tn_w":166,"tn_h":200,"tim":1789745192869443,"time":1789745192,"md5":"xblYs7zgNzb5O0noi\/MjrQ==","fsize":1319448,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"sthg-sonic-the-hedgehog-general","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":574,"images":207,"omitted_posts":574,"omitted_images":207,"last_replies":[],"last_modified":1789782281},{"no":581450148,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)05:31:29","name":"Anonymous","sub":"\/terag\/ - TERA Classic+ General #32","com":"Bigger Edition<br><br>TERA is a Korean action MMORPG originally released in 2011. Its biggest selling point was its real-time action combat: instead of traditional tab-targeting, attacks are aimed manually, enemies have hitboxes, skills can be chained together, and dodging\/blocking\/positioning are major parts of combat.<br>The game features 13 classes, ranging from traditional MMO roles like Lancer (tank), Priest\/Mystic (healer), and Slayer\/Berserker (DPS), to more unusual classes such as Brawler, Ninja, Reaper, Gunner, and Valkyrie. The world is built around leveling, BAMs (Big-Ass Monsters), 5-man dungeons, gear progression, and PvP.<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;TERA Europe Classic+<\/span><br>Classic+ is a community-built, free-to-play version of classic TERA, launched August 21, 2026. It isn&#039;t simply a recreation of one specific historical patch. It uses TERA&#039;s modern 64-bit v100.02 client combining classic systems, restored content, things from different eras, rebalancing, and custom content.<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;What makes Classic+ different?<\/span><br>Level cap: 65. All 13 classes. No Apex skills. Original Island of Dawn restored as the starting area. Classic leveling dungeons restored and rebalanced for 5-player parties. Progression runs through the classic dungeon lineup from Bastion of Lok all the way to Kelsaik&#039;s Nest. Custom endgame content, including Heaven&#039;s Arena. Separate PvE (Mournshard) and PvP (Skyshard) gear progression. PvE and PvP economies interact through tradeable materials. Built-in launcher\/mod manager with hundreds of visual mods. Shinra Meter and TERA Custom Cooldowns are supported\/bundled. f2p with no p2w progression.<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;TERA Europe Classic+ site<\/span><br>https:\/\/tera-europe-classic.com\/<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;FREE stuff<\/span><br>ROLLBACK (until 09\/19, only 65, no new accounts)<br>LAUNCH-DELAY-500<br>LAG-COMPENSATION<br>COMPENSATION-500<br>Valid until 23\/09 (allegedly)<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;\/vg\/ guild<\/span><br>[No Fun Allowed]<br>G -&gt; Search &quot;No Fun Allowed&quot; -&gt; join (put \/vg\/)<br>NFA Crafting: https:\/\/rentry.org\/NFAcrafts<br><br>Last thread:<br><a href=\"\/vg\/thread\/581346538#p581346538\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;581346538<\/a>","filename":"bigger","ext":".jpg","w":620,"h":350,"tn_w":200,"tn_h":112,"tim":1789723889550345,"time":1789723889,"md5":"AUG00SPBBUtSGk+xGvGu6g==","fsize":53252,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"terag-tera-classic-ge