kov\/<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Arena website<\/span><br>https:\/\/arena.tarkov.com\/<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Ammo charts<\/span><br>https:\/\/eft-ammo.com<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Gun Builder Website (Overswing calculator included)<\/span><br>https:\/\/db4tarkov.com\/gun<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;For the newfags<\/span><br>https:\/\/pastebin.com\/a9eHz03X<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Written guide for the newfags<\/span><br>https:\/\/docs.google.com\/document\/d\/<wbr>1j_fZzhBmvKCDJEaqFBNlX0IjVyu6ZZu8ip<wbr>NbfP5tT7k\/edit<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Quest tracker<\/span><br>https:\/\/tarkovtracker.io\/#\/overview<wbr><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;All your Tarkov sneeds website<\/span><br>https:\/\/tarkov.dev\/<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Cultist Circle Calculator<\/span><br>https:\/\/www.cultistcircle.com\/<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Battle Pass Document Maps<\/span><br>https:\/\/tarkovdocsmap.com\/<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Change list<\/span><br>https:\/\/tarkov-changes.com\/changes<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Discord<\/span><br>There is no \/eftg\/ Discord. Any implication otherwise is made by trannies and retards.<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;SPT<\/span><br>SPT is a single player modded Tarkov that is no longer supported by its developers.<br><br>MIA:<a href=\"\/vg\/thread\/580657169#p580657169\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;580657169<\/a>","filename":"HSCUllfaMAAJbqZ","ext":".jpg","w":4096,"h":2897,"tn_w":200,"tn_h":141,"tim":1789507310345705,"time":1789507310,"md5":"OG6iTmiDK3EZ9s4uy7Zh+w==","fsize":2170055,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"eftg-escape-from-tarkov-general","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":672,"images":134,"omitted_posts":672,"omitted_images":134,"last_replies":[],"last_modified":1789781904},{"no":581466085,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)09:33:21","name":"Anonymous","sub":"\/anii\/ - Aniimo General","com":"Previous: <a href=\"\/vg\/thread\/581309067#p581309067\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;581309067<\/a><br><br>Aniimo is a character-swapping action game at its core. You have a customizable human (game&#039;s monetization happens here), and there are 100 monsters with 1-6 special forms each. The special forms often add secondary types and moves to them. Some regional or weather-related, some based on special materials, etc. You build a party of 4 with different roles and types, and you explore with them.<br><br>Gamescom trailer: https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=VDx<wbr>khEwRU28<br>Official site and download: https:\/\/www.aniimo.com\/<br>Official wiki: https:\/\/wiki.aniimo.com\/<br><br>Resources:<br>https:\/\/aniimotools.dev\/type-chart\/<wbr><br>https:\/\/aniidex.com\/<br>https:\/\/www.hideoutgacha.com\/games\/<wbr>aniimo\/interactive-map<br><br>Codes:<br>ANIIMOGIFT<br>Aniimo2026<br>twinewithaniimo<br>aniimoopenworld<br>aniimolaunch2026<br>anyoneaniimo","filename":"1789718567846505","ext":".png","w":573,"h":437,"tn_w":200,"tn_h":152,"tim":1789738401259878,"time":1789738401,"md5":"RlP2nPnp8wcq\/+tQZ+h77Q==","fsize":366964,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"anii-aniimo-general","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":414,"images":127,"omitted_posts":414,"omitted_images":127,"last_replies":[],"last_modified":1789781889},{"no":580833653,"now":"09\/13\/26(Sun)04:56:02","name":"Anonymous","sub":"\/lisg\/ Life is Strange General #1326","com":"Legacy edition<br><br>Previous thread: <a href=\"\/vg\/thread\/578982947#p578982947\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;578982947<\/a><br><br>An episodic narrative adventure game by developer Don\u2019t Nod (DN). Set in the fictional coastal town of Arcadia Bay, Oregon, it follows Max Caulfield, a shy, awkward photography student who discovers she can rewind time and\u2014perhaps more urgently\u2014that she\u2019s very, very gay. At the heart of the story is Max\u2019s reunion with her estranged best friend, the rebellious, blue-haired Chloe Price. Their bond becomes the game\u2019s pulsing queer core as they unravel the mystery of Rachel Amber\u2019s disappearance. What begins as a teenage reconnection blooms into a messy, tender queer odyssey about grief, desire, and the impossible choices we make for the people we can&#039;t truly live without.<br><br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Official Websites:<\/span><br>https:\/\/lifeisstrange.com\/<br>https:\/\/dont-nod.com\/en\/<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Don&#039;t Nod LiS Games<\/span><br>Life is Strange<br>The Awesome Adventures of Captain Spirit<br>Life is Strange 2<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Deck Nine LiS Games<\/span><br>Life is Strange: Before the Storm<br>Life is Strange: True Colors<br>Life is Strange: Double Exposure<br>Life is Strange: Reunion<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Life is Strange Series Steam:<\/span><br>https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/cura<wbr>tor\/36149206<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;\/lisg\/ Permalink:<\/span><br>http:\/\/orph.link\/lisg<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;FAQs, Old Threads\/Strawpolls, Soundtrack\/Music &amp; Leaks:<\/span><br>http:\/\/orph.link\/lisgarchive<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;\/lisg\/ Community Written Fan Fiction:<\/span><br>http:\/\/orph.link\/story<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Compilation of Fanfics:<\/span><br>http:\/\/orph.link\/fanfic<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;\/lisg\/ Content Producers:<\/span><br>http:\/\/imgur.com\/a\/DOAKn<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Art of LiS:<\/span><br>https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=265<wbr>yHETXRXo [Embed]<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;\/lis\/ sings:<\/span><br>Obstacles<br>https:\/\/web.archive.org\/web\/2020032<wbr>4102651\/https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/wat<wbr>ch?v=WjPsOkijFh0<br>Glass Walls<br>https:\/\/www.mediafire.com\/file\/1y58<wbr>4yhvq5p2y35\/Glass+walls+lisg+editio<wbr>n.mp3<br>No Below<br>https:\/\/www.mediafire.com\/file\/cpi7<wbr>9dyuahemkd4\/Lisg+sings+no+below+all<wbr>+v.mp3<br><br>Discussion of other LiS games in the series like Life is S