 \u2013 Editing: 80%<br>Pastel Chime 3 - announced<br>Daiteikoku - TL Announced<br>http:\/\/mangagamer.org\/rance\/<br>https:\/\/twitter.com\/Alicesoft_en<br>Translated Rance Games on Steam<br>https:\/\/www.kaguragames.com\/rance-i<wbr>s-finally-coming-to-steam\/<br><br>35th anniversary site:<br>https:\/\/alicesoft35th.com<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Emergency \/ghost\/ Posting<\/span><br>https:\/\/arch.b4k.dev\/vg\/thread\/5333<wbr>01678\/","filename":"149605115_p0","ext":".jpg","w":2428,"h":1720,"tn_w":199,"tn_h":141,"tim":1789312553137779,"time":1789312553,"md5":"J6WI9qfNZ\/aGhS8cLItRaQ==","fsize":1291075,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"haniho-alicesoftrance-general","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":587,"images":157,"omitted_posts":587,"omitted_images":157,"last_replies":[],"last_modified":1789781225},{"no":580995283,"now":"09\/14\/26(Mon)13:59:27","name":"Anonymous","sub":"\/sg\/ - S.T.A.L.K.E.R. General","com":"Retarded pedophile got permabanned Edition<br>___________________________________<wbr>_______________________<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;BugTrap, crash to desktop, freeze\/lockup? Find your crash log, Stalker.<\/span><br>Check your Documents or game install directories for the xray_[your name].log file. If you can&#039;t find it, look in the location specified at the top of fsgame.ltx.<br>Copy the last few lines from the log and paste them here if you want any help.<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Quickstart Guide<\/span><br>docs.google.com\/document\/d\/1cnQeURG<wbr>CjHTRPOGJH8G5ijP1fw5vbVWSE7opABcBpN<wbr>k<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Start Guide, beginner tips, and much more<\/span><br>pastebin.com\/FUPEbLiv<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Mod Guide<\/span><br>docs.google.com\/document\/d\/1JPA0hQZ<wbr>VJ6mSvTsp6Sy3CoAkObJOKeoPHEamDC19Li<wbr>o<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Miscellaneous Guide<\/span><br>docs.google.com\/document\/d\/103nyaAM<wbr>5PKgBwuZ35jRbv7VM7tEcvi1Scv6boOMe1R<wbr>M<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;HUD Guide, modding basics, mod reviews, and AMK mod guide<\/span><br>docs.google.com\/document\/d\/10yi79NU<wbr>FhJrFO4hmGeKqaWSw35BJQv0Ve0OK94ioME<wbr>w<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Performance Guides, Steam settings<\/span><br>pastebin.com\/nzXEevG7<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Common misconceptions about Shadow of Chernobyl game mechanics<\/span><br>metacognix.com\/stlkrsoc\/WhatYouKnow<wbr>ThatAintSo.html<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Running S.T.A.L.K.E.R. on Linux<\/span><br>docs.google.com\/document\/d\/11HcSFSy<wbr>b0DX3ymModXZ9tNdpTuktTioC<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Xetrill&#039;s Modified LuaJIT for CS\/CoP - improves performance, especially in script-heavy mods<\/span><br>mega.co.nz\/#F!BIISmQgK!KHZR01ljznUq<wbr>JlcHUax-aQ<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Game Repacks + Modding Tools<\/span><br>mega.nz\/folder\/gSBHmYYK#9-5ONxPwwCh<wbr>JhYSPWdKb5Q<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Downgrade Patches (drag-and-drop)<\/span><br>mega.co.nz\/#F!M4BmDRCL!vfze70GSJDyv<wbr>-HzWn7Dwww<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;S.T.A.L.K.E.R. Mod Portal Wiki<\/span><br>sdk.stalker-game.com\/en\/index.php?t<wbr>itle=S.T.A.L.K.E.R._MOD_portal<br>___________________________________<wbr>_______________________<br>Lost to the Zone <span class=\"deadlink\">&gt;&gt;580976775<\/span>","filename":"1766651684842213","ext":".webm","w":1280,"h":720,"tn_w":200,"tn_h":112,"tim":1789408767705333,"time":1789408767,"md5":"nlw55zlkiwT69RSUFp1s2A==","fsize":3384902,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"sg-stalker-general","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":748,"images":162,"omitted_posts":748,"omitted_images":162,"last_replies":[],"last_modified":1789781192},{"no":581109054,"now":"09\/15\/26(Tue)12:35:22","name":"Anonymous","sub":"\/waifu\/ waifu general #59","com":"Previous thread <a href=\"\/vg\/thread\/580645596#p580645596\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;580645596<\/a><br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;what is \/waifu\/<\/span><br>This is a thread for those who have fallen in love with a videogame girl.<br>Discuss what it is that makes her so special to you, what sorts of in-game content related to her you enjoy or are looking forward to, or post shrines, merch, or fanart of her.<br>Or just gush about how much you love her! This is the place for that!<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;what exactly *is* a waifu?<\/span><br>Waifu simply means wife, it&#039;s the same feeling that any man has when he falls in love with a woman in real life, but in our case, she just so happened to be 2D. And in that same vein, love is between only two people, and it&#039;s for life.<br>More than one waifu will ruin your laifu, and waifu is forever!<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;collages?<\/span><br>Every two months we put together a drawing\/photo collage, typically themed around the holiday of that season. Submit a drawing\/photo in the thread and everyone&#039;s pics will be put together in one big ol&#039; collage showing off everyone&#039;s efforts!<br>It&#039;s all about expressing your love, not artistic ability, so don&#039;t think you shouldn&#039;t participate just because you&#039;re not a master artist, and you could always submit a holiday themed photo of a shrine, a pic of food you&#039;ve cooked up for your waifu, or participate in any way you can show your love!<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;question for the thread <\/span><br>Is your wife a HERO, a VILLAIN, or something in between?","filename":"1788925777168318(1)","ext":".jpg","w":2400,"h":3171,"tn_w":151,"tn_h":200,"tim":1789490122510860,"time":1789490122,"md5":"3A96Fc7gK0Ti1wxpVRx8pw==","fsize":3659918,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"waifu-waifu-general-59","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":369,"images":247,"omitted_posts":369,"omitted_images":247,"last_replies":[],"last_modified":1789781132},{"no":581375162,"now":"09\/17\/26(Thu)14:51:28","name":"Anonymous","sub":"\/gtag\/ - Grand Theft Auto General","com":"On life support edition<br><br>PC Crew -