iler feat. Tifa<\/span><br>https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=9dx<wbr>DjF_dOXc<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Latest Patch Notes<\/span><br>https:\/\/www.streetfighter.com\/6\/buc<wbr>kler\/en\/battle_change<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;The official Capcom Pro Tour website is live<\/span><br>https:\/\/sf.esports.capcom.com\/cpt\/<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;High level replays<\/span><br>https:\/\/replaytheater.app\/?game=sf6<wbr><br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Street Fighter 6 Frame Data<\/span><br>https:\/\/ultimateframedata.com\/sf6\/<br>https:\/\/fullmeter.com\/fatonline\/#\/c<wbr>alculators<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;SuperCombo Wiki<\/span><br>https:\/\/wiki.supercombo.gg\/w\/Street<wbr>_Fighter_6<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Fighting Game Glossary<\/span><br>https:\/\/glossary.infil.net\/<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Use Fightcade to play ST, A2, A3, 3S, CVS2, etc.<\/span><br>https:\/\/www.fightcade.com\/<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Daigo drills (warm-up routine)<\/span><br>https:\/\/pastebin.com\/nWRv2BkL<br><br>Last Round: <a href=\"\/vg\/thread\/581370369#p581370369\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;581370369<\/a>","filename":"1788981770857957","ext":".jpg","w":780,"h":1024,"tn_w":152,"tn_h":200,"tim":1789721325061148,"time":1789721325,"md5":"G7MNCGA\/sYNHC07Zx1qNvA==","fsize":44462,"resto":0,"bumplimit":1,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"sfg-street-fighter-general","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":784,"images":216,"omitted_posts":784,"omitted_images":216,"last_replies":[],"last_modified":1789781583},{"no":581363389,"now":"09\/17\/26(Thu)13:16:00","name":"Anonymous","sub":"\/bgg\/ - Baldur&#039;s Gate General","com":"Daughter of Murder Edition<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;News:<\/span><br>Patch 8: https:\/\/baldursgate3.game\/news\/the-<wbr>final-patch-new-subclasses-photo-mo<wbr>de-and-cross-play_138<br>Patch 7: https:\/\/baldursgate3.game\/news\/patc<wbr>h-7-now-live_121<br>Patch 6: https:\/\/baldursgate3.game\/news\/patc<wbr>h-6-now-live_108<br>Patch 5: https:\/\/baldursgate3.game\/news\/patc<wbr>h-5-now-live_99<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Wiki:<\/span><br>https:\/\/bg3.wiki<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Mods:<\/span><br>https:\/\/www.nexusmods.com\/baldursga<wbr>te3\/<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;FAQ:<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Q: How often should I long rest?<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;A: Many companion and romance interactions occur when long resting. Some early lower priority camp scenes can also be missed if higher priority ones are queued. To advance companion quests or romances, make sure to long rest often.<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Q: Can I recruit Minthara without going down the evil path?<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;A: If you knock her out in Act 1, yes. You do miss out on the sex scene, but otherwise the romance remains the same.<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Q: Underdark or Mountain Pass?<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;A: Either, or both. It&#039;s recommended to clear both on higher difficulties for the experience and loot. Both connect to the same Act 2 map.<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Q: Is The Dark Urge essentially &quot;Tav+&quot;?<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;A: Yes. You get additional content, BUT there are points where, if you&#039;ve chosen to resist the Urge and\/or don&#039;t complete quests the &quot;right&quot; way, you&#039;ll have to pass additional checks to avoid losing companions.<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Q: Are there any consequences to consuming tadpoles?<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;A: <\/span><s>No, for the most part. However if you&#039;ve consumed any tadpoles, there will later be a DC 21 Wisdom check to reject the Astral-Touched Tadpole, which affects your appearance if consumed.<\/s><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Q: Should I enable Karmic Dice?<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;A: Karmic Dice will avoid streaks of low rolls, both for you and the enemy. It is recommended to disable it if you&#039;re specializing.<\/span><br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Polls:<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Romance: https:\/\/strawpoll.com\/NMnQ5kJXYn6<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Race: https:\/\/strawpoll.com\/kjn18WPzeyQ<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Class: https:\/\/strawpoll.com\/eNg69DKKjnA<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Companions: https:\/\/strawpoll.com\/bVg8o8l3VnY<\/span><br><br>OP pasta: https:\/\/rentry.org\/bggpasta<br><br>Previous thread: <a href=\"\/vg\/thread\/580872807#p580872807\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;580872807<\/a>","filename":"1717504028474","ext":".png","w":1920,"h":1080,"tn_w":200,"tn_h":112,"tim":1789665360754526,"time":1789665360,"md5":"iN+yXch6kue1wke42fGUTw==","fsize":2904266,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"bgg-baldurs-gate-general","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":243,"images":79,"omitted_posts":243,"omitted_images":79,"last_replies":[],"last_modified":1789779468},{"no":580558421,"now":"09\/10\/26(Thu)20:00:46","name":"Anonymous","sub":"\/horg\/ - Horror Games General","com":"Fear &amp; Hunger 2: Termina Edition<br><br>Welcome to \/horg\/, the place to discuss anything horror games-related, such as:<br>- AAA series: Resident Evil, Silent Hill, Dead Space, Alan Wake, Alien Isolation, Dying Light etc.<br>- Current indie games and hidden gems: Hollowbody, Echoes of the Living, Carnival Massacre, Post Trauma, THE MUTE HOUSE, Heavy Metal Death Can, Ground Zero, Fear The Timeloop, Perished Truth, Tormented Souls, etc.<br>- Retro classics: Alone in the Dark, Clock Tower, Dino Crisis, Eternal Darkness, Fatal Frame, Parasite Eve, Sweet Home, System Shock, etc.<br>- Free mods: HL1&#039;s Afraid of Monsters and Cry Of Fear, Doom&#039;s MyHouse.wad and Total Chaos, fan-made games like Blood: Death Wish, Penumbra: Necrologue, Resident Evil REVisited, stand-alone free games like SCP Containment Breach, etc.<br><b